{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>同一場景要分別拍直向短片與橫向影片，往往需要重複錄影。AspectTake 讓 iPhone 用戶一次拍攝就同時取得直向與橫向兩段獨立影片，適合經營社交平台短片的創作者，以及需要橫向素材作簡報、課程、訪談或後期剪輯的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>單次拍攝同步輸出兩種畫面</h2>\n<p>AspectTake 讓你一次錄影同時取得 9:16 直向與 16:9 橫向兩段獨立影片，錄製期間可即時預覽兩種構圖，並把橫向預覽拖到畫面任何位置或貼齊邊緣。支援 iPhone 可用的解像度與影格率，兼容裝置最高達 4K 及 24、30、60 fps，開拍前可查看預計檔案大小，亦可啟用構圖格線與閃光燈。兩段影片會同步儲存至「照片」，權限不足時仍可保留在 App 內。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-156-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-157-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-158-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-159-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AspectTake: Dual Format Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.676874+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":397,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:11:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:34.406023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:34.406023+00:00","content_hash":"791aab6085d38ebb0bcbf3312410936b9bbfafc39e65f2d9f5a1d71fc4306e52","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}